oll shows Foulkes ahead of Block by nine points, though coverage notes Block is closing the gap after a MAGA-aligned candidate endorsed him, potentially consolidating right-of-center voters behind a single challenger.\n\nEvery major rater, including Cook Political Report, Inside Elections, Sabato's Crystal Ball and the Silver Bulletin, calls the race Solid or Safe Democratic, and prediction markets put Foulkes' chances in the mid-nineties. Rhode Island's Democratic lean and a Democratic Governors Association advertising campaign backing Foulkes give her the edge. Attacks over her CVS role in the opioid settlement are Block's main remaining avenue, but time is short.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.996, "margin": 18.1}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.997, "margin": 18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9964, "margin": 18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9941, "margin": 18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9953, "margin": 18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9924, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9959, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.998, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9963, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.995, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.995, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9875, "margin": 16.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9875, "margin": 16.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9966, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9927, "margin": 18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9969, "margin": 18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9973, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9956, "margin": 18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9951, "margin": 18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9943, "margin": 18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.9959, "margin": 18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.9947, "margin": 18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.9948, "margin": 18.0}, {"dat